      "content": "Instead of hiding the lower percentage, frame the 5% increase within a comprehensive analysis of the project's environment and challenges. Detail *why* the impact was modest, linking it to specific environmental obstacles or unexpected variables. Then, pivot immediately to explain the actionable learnings from that data, showing precisely how your methodology will be refined to achieve the 20% goal in the next phase. This demonstrates strong scientific rigor and proactive problem-solving, which funders value highly.",
